{"unit_id":"skyjjgw__dsh-version-guard#feature-1","repo":"skyjjgw/dsh-version-guard","commit":"99ba740f0340d7e53a76cd246b7e93df7c0f1f0f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 版本守卫的功能「健康启动回退点」：宿主检测到 Web 服务已能响应后，记录启动成功并按配置保存 profile 快照。插件启动时开始记录，服务确认正常后完成记录；默认最多保留 30 个快照。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host/index.js:120","lib/core/store.js:26"]}
